title: Second Ruhr Strike
new-page: true
is-card: true
tags: govt_affairs, cabinet, party_aff
on-arrival: {!
Q.labor_affairs_timer = 2;

!}
on-display: {!
function renderRuhrStruggle(){
  var host = document.getElementById('ruhr-charts');
  if (!host) return;

  var left = Q.ruhr_camp_left || 0;
  var rep  = Q.ruhr_camp_republic || 0;
  var right = Q.ruhr_camp_right || 0;
  var total = left + rep + right;
  if (total <= 0) total = 1;

  var leftPct  = Math.round((left / total) * 1000) / 10;
  var repPct   = Math.round((rep / total) * 1000) / 10;
  var rightPct = Math.round((right / total) * 1000) / 10;

  var COLOR_LEFT = '#c0392b';
  var COLOR_REP  = '#3a5a6b';
  var COLOR_RIGHT = '#4a4642';

  host.innerHTML = `
    <div style="margin: 12px 0 20px 0;">
      <div style="display:flex; justify-content:space-between; font-size:0.85em; margin-bottom:4px; opacity:0.85;">
        <span style="color:${COLOR_LEFT}">LEFT ${leftPct}%</span>
        <span style="color:${COLOR_REP}">REPUBLIC ${repPct}%</span>
        <span style="color:${COLOR_RIGHT}">RIGHT ${rightPct}%</span>
      </div>
      <div style="display:flex; width:100%; height:28px; border-radius:6px; overflow:hidden; box-shadow: inset 0 0 0 1px rgba(0,0,0,0.2);">
        <div style="width:${leftPct}%; background:${COLOR_LEFT};"></div>
        <div style="width:${repPct}%; background:${COLOR_REP};"></div>
        <div style="width:${rightPct}%; background:${COLOR_RIGHT};"></div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div style="display:flex; gap:16px; justify-content:space-between; flex-wrap:wrap;">
      ${ruhrCampColumn('LEFT', COLOR_LEFT, [
          ['KAPD', Q.ruhr_kapd_effective],
          ['FAUD', Q.ruhr_faud_effective],
          ['RFB', Q.ruhr_rfb_effective],
          ['RB (defected)', Q.ruhr_rb_to_left],
          ['Independent workers', Q.ruhr_worker_independent]
        ])}
      ${ruhrCampColumn('REPUBLIC', COLOR_REP, [
          ['Reichswehr (loyal)', Q.reichswehr_strength * (Q.reichswehr_loyalty || 0.5) * Q.reichswehr_militancy],
          ['Reichsbanner', Q.ruhr_rb_remaining],
          ['Jungdo', Q.ruhr_jungdo_effective]
        ])}
      ${ruhrCampColumn('RIGHT', COLOR_RIGHT, [
          ['Reichswehr (disloyal)', Q.ruhr_rw_order],
          ['SA', Q.ruhr_sa_backing],
          ['Stahlhelm', Q.ruhr_sh_backing],
          ['Employers', Q.ruhr_employer_share]
        ])}
    </div>
  `;
}

function ruhrCampColumn(label, color, rows){
  var total = rows.reduce(function(s, r){ return s + (r[1] || 0); }, 0) || 1;
  var rowsHtml = rows.map(function(r){
    var name = r[0], val = r[1] || 0;
    var pct = Math.round((val / total) * 1000) / 10;
    return `
      <div style="margin-bottom:6px;">
        <div style="display:flex; justify-content:space-between; font-size:0.78em; opacity:0.85;">
          <span>${name}</span><span>${pct}%</span>
        </div>
        <div style="width:100%; height:6px; background:rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius:3px; overflow:hidden;">
          <div style="width:${pct}%; height:100%; background:${color};"></div>
        </div>
      </div>`;
  }).join('');

  return `
    <div style="flex:1; min-width:150px;">
      <div style="font-size:0.9em; font-weight:600; color:${color}; margin-bottom:8px; text-transform:uppercase; letter-spacing:0.05em;">${label}</div>
      ${rowsHtml}
    </div>`;
}

renderRuhrStruggle();
!}
view-if: labor_affairs_timer = 0 and ruhr_labor_strike == 1
card-image: img/ruhr_iron_strike_second_1.png

= Second Ruhr Strike

The industrial Ruhr region is aflame with labor unrest and practically communist rebellion. We need to solve this as soon as possible, it seems.

<div id="ruhr-charts"></div>

- @suppress_rfb: Attack the far left paramilitaties.
- @suppress_sa_sh: Attack the far right paramilitaries.
- @easy_discard


@suppress_rfb
subtitle: We should coordinate our attacks with Reichswehr.
choose-if: rb_militancy > 0.05 and rb_strength > 1800 and kpd_relation <= 50
view-if: ideology != "left" and not kpd_truce
unavailable-subtitle: [? if rb_militancy <= 0.05 or rb_strength <= 1800: Our units are not strong enough to contest armed enemies! ?]
on-arrival: {!
  // fraction of RB still loyal enough to actually fight the left
  var rb_loyal_pct = 1 - (Q.ruhr_rb_to_left_pct || 0);
  var rb_committed = Q.rb_strength * rb_loyal_pct * Q.rb_militancy;

  // resistance from each left paramilitary
  var rfb_resistance = Q.rfb_strength * Q.rfb_militancy;
  var faud_resistance = (Q.ruhr_faud_strength || 0) * (Q.ruhr_faud_militancy || 0);
  var kapd_resistance = (Q.ruhr_kapd_strength || 0) * (Q.ruhr_kapd_militancy || 0);

  // ratio of RB's committed force vs each front's resistance
  var rfb_ratio = rb_committed / (rb_committed + rfb_resistance);
  var faud_ratio = rb_committed / (rb_committed + faud_resistance);
  var kapd_ratio = rb_committed / (rb_committed + kapd_resistance);

  // RB losses rise as resistance holds firmer across all three fronts
  Q.rb_loss = Math.round(60 * (1 - ((rfb_ratio + faud_ratio + kapd_ratio) / 3)));
  Q.rb_strength -= Q.rb_loss;

  // damage to each group scales with its own ratio
  Q.rfb_loss = Math.round(30 * rfb_ratio);
  Q.rfb_strength -= Q.rfb_loss;

  Q.faud_loss = Math.round(20 * faud_ratio);
  Q.ruhr_faud_strength -= Q.faud_loss;

  Q.kapd_loss = Math.round(20 * kapd_ratio);
  Q.ruhr_kapd_strength -= Q.kapd_loss;

  Q.left_dissent += 5;
  Q.left_strength += 5;
!}

We have assaulted Red Front, FAUD, and KAPD positions with loyal Reichsbanner units on three fronts.

Casualties:

- Reichsbanner: [+ rb_loss +]

- Red Front (RFB): [+ rfb_loss +]

- FAUD: [+ faud_loss +]

- KAPD: [+ kapd_loss +]

@suppress_sa_sh
subtitle: We should coordinate our attacks with Reichswehr against both paramilitaries.
choose-if: rb_militancy > 0.10 and rb_strength > 2500 and dnvp_relation <= 40
view-if: not social_fascism_adopted
unavailable-subtitle: [? if rb_militancy <= 0.10 or rb_strength <= 2500: Our units are not strong enough to contest armed enemies! ?]
on-arrival: {!
  // RB's committed fighting force
  var rb_committed = Q.rb_strength * Q.rb_militancy;

  // how much resistance each enemy puts up
  var sa_resistance = Q.sa_strength * Q.sa_militancy;
  var sh_resistance = Q.sh_strength * Q.sh_militancy;

  // ratio of RB's committed force vs each enemy's resistance
  var sa_ratio = rb_committed / (rb_committed + sa_resistance);
  var sh_ratio = rb_committed / (rb_committed + sh_resistance);

  // RB losses rise as enemy resistance holds firmer (avg of both fronts)
  Q.rb_loss = Math.round(50 * (1 - ((sa_ratio + sh_ratio) / 2)));
  Q.rb_strength -= Q.rb_loss;

  // damage to each enemy scales with how favorable that front's ratio is
  Q.sa_loss = Math.round(30 * sa_ratio);
  Q.sa_strength -= Q.sa_loss;

  Q.sh_loss = Math.round(30 * sh_ratio);
  Q.sh_strength -= Q.sh_loss;

  Q.left_dissent += 5;
  Q.left_strength += 5;
!}

We have assaulted Sturmabteilung and Stahlhelm positions with loyal Reichsbanner units on two fronts.

Casualties:

- Reichsbanner: [+ rb_loss +]

- Sturmabteilung (SA): [+ sa_loss +]

- Stahlhelm (SH): [+ sh_loss +]


